Companion audit to the chrclient/chrserver rewrite. Confirms every
command the rewritten client can send maps 1:1 onto a real, already-
implemented firmware capability, and that the robot's only genuine
sensors (GPS, temperature, raindrop, camera) match what the client now
displays. See AUDIT_NOTES_client_server_alignment.md for details.
